OL,3,GNEWSAMP and TV presenter join data
OL,4,Acentre opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a huge data centre should be
OL,7,Fblocked as it could harm neighbouring
OL,8,Fnature sites, an MP and a broadcaster
OL,9,Fboth said.
OL,11,FBen Goldsborough, Labour MP for South
OL,12,FNorfolk, has joined presenter Jake
OL,13,FHumphrey in objecting to the Norwich
OL,14,FApex Data Centre in Keswick, on the
OL,15,Foutskirts of Norwich.
OL,17,FPlans for the scheme were lodged last
OL,18,Fweek with South Norfolk Council, which
OL,19,Frevealed the scale of the 150 Megawatt
OL,20,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
