OL,3,GNEWSAMP and TV presenter join data
OL,4,Acentre opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FHumphrey, who lives close to the site
OL,7,Foff Ipswich Road, said he was worried
OL,8,Fabout the noise it would produce,
OL,9,Fadding: "We need to build for the
OL,10,Ffuture, but we should not ask ordinary
OL,11,Fcommunities to pay the price for it."
